          ],
          "pWrong": 0.8
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Quinn:KSante:1",
          "text": "Fight him early while he has little health and armor. His tankiness grows with items, and you fall behind in a long, drawn-out lane.",
          "refs": [],
          "pWrong": 0.35
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Quinn:KSante:2",
          "text": "Use Vault to dash in, hit, then leap back out. The slow it applies helps you step away from his follow-up.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Quinn-E", "start": 4, "end": 9 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.09
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Quinn:KSante:3",
          "text": "Stay out of his Ntofo Strikes range once he has hit you with it once. The second cast stuns and pulls you in, so back off before he can land it.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KSante-Q", "start": 16, "end": 29 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "stunned", "start": 86, "end": 91 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.87
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Quinn:KSante:4",
          "text": "Watch for his Path Maker charge. When he starts raising his weapons, step sideways out of the line, because a longer charge means a longer stun.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "KSante-W", "start": 14, "end": 24 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "stunned", "start": 139, "end": 143 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.34
        },
